  "navTitle": "Stryker employees making global impact with the 2023 Volunteer Challenge",
  "customizablearea_parsys": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
    "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 14:52:45 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>At Stryker, we invest in the power of helping those in need and giving back to our communities.&nbsp;Whether it’s by volunteering locally or donating globally, our people are driven to give.&nbsp;We work to&nbsp;advance healthcare, support education, improve environmental health and enrich community culture — while keeping equity top of mind.&nbsp;Through our social impact efforts, we aim to create lasting change with stronger people and a healthier planet. Our charitable giving is amplified when employees are given the time to volunteer their talents.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 08 2023 14:52:49 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_1515752763": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 14:52:53 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">That’s why Stryker launched the 2023 Volunteer Challenge —</span></span> an initiative challenging every employee to volunteer the equivalent of one day in 2023 and track it on Impact, our global giving and volunteering platform.</p>\n<p>Stryker’s Chair and CEO, Kevin Lobo, announced the launch in February, empowering employees to amplify our impact worldwide. Employees can utilize their Volunteer Leave of Absence* to spend a day giving back to those in need.</p>\n<p>“We’re a successful company, and with success comes responsibility,” said Kevin. “We want to help uplift our communities around the world.”</p>\n<p>In addition to a paid day of volunteering, employees can also earn rewards for their time. For every hour of volunteer time tracked on Impact, employees earn money to donate to the causes they wish to support.</p>\n<p>The impact of the 2023 Volunteer Challenge is already evident. This year, more employees have already volunteered and tracked their time in the first quarter than in all of 2022.</p>\n<p>Across the globe, Stryker employees are volunteering to make a difference.<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 08 2023 15:12:15 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_1984123155": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 14:54:09 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Shaping the future of vulnerable Colombian youth<br>\n</span> </span><br>\nFor children and young adults growing up in unstable environments, higher education can seem unattainable. When each day is spent searching for food, water and shelter, very little time is left for thinking of the future.</p>\n<p>That’s why Jennifer Rodriguez, a Senior HR Specialist in Colombia, set out to educate and inspire at-risk youth. By introducing them to Stryker, she hoped to spark an interest in the medical industry and highlight available opportunities. To achieve her goal, Jennifer collaborated with&nbsp;a nonprofit organization committed to the protection and rehabilitation of street children facing conditions of great vulnerability and violation of their fundamental rights.</p>\n<p>After two months of hard work and collaboration, the initiative took place on March 31. With the help of a product showroom and support from a team of 25 volunteers, the day was spent inspiring the young adults to enter the medical field. “The most rewarding part of this volunteer day was seeing their interest in Stryker products,” said Jennifer. “It was beautiful to hear their dreams for the future.”<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 17 2023 16:43:42 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
