      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_76406084_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 14:59:34 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Traveling with a group of European volunteers, Can visited two major cities and 36 villages while distributing vital resources to Turkish families.</p>\n<p>A key point in Can’s mission took place at a field hospital set up by the French government. Utilizing his unique skillset as a bilingual speaker, Can spent two days of his trip serving as a translator for the hospital and its patients.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Aug 08 2023 15:13:47 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_1286687583_copy_385041870": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 15:00:46 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>Thanks to Stryker's volunteer rewards program, Can’s week of humanitarian aid generated additional benefits. For every hour tracked throughout his trip, Can earned money on Impact to give back to a cause of his choice.<br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 18 2023 18:15:38 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_1286687583_copy_2005380009": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "2",
          "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "leftPadding": "5",
          "topPadding": "5",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 15:00:46 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">“</span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">You get home after a trip like this, and you feel so grateful for what you have,” says Can. “There are people all around the world that need our help, and I hope my story inspires Stryker employees to get involved in volunteering activities.</span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">”</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 17 2023 16:42:47 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(237,238,236,1)",
          "showDimensionalBox": "true",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_1286687583_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Aug 08 2023 15:00:46 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*Guaranteed through the U.S. paid leave of absence program; employees outside of the U.S. are following local guidance for paid volunteer time.<br>\n<i> </i>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Aug 17 2023 16:42:23 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
